  <main><section class="page-intro"><h1>Our products</h1><p>Discover Weasy Rider accessories designed for your motorcycle.</p><h2 style="color: #ff5959; font-weight: 900; width: fit-content; padding: .35em .65em; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 6px">Hazard light kit for Moto Guzzi</h2>
